<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CSS 2D Transform - matrix()</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --border-color: #e2e8f0;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-sub: #64748b;
            
            /* 액센트 컬러 */
            --red-main: #ef4444;
            --blue-main: #3b82f6;
            --emerald-main: #10b981;
            --purple-main: #8b5cf6;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 680px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        p.description {
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* matrix 파라미터 가이드 칩 */
        .matrix-guide {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .guide-chip {
            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .guide-chip span {
            color: var(--purple-main);
        }

        .demo-section {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .demo-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .demo-card label {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .code-tag {
            font-family: monospace;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: var(--purple-main);
        }

        /* 원래 위치 및 크기를 표시하는 가이드 */
        .box-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            width: 150px;
            height: 80px;
            border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background-color: rgba(241, 245, 249, 0.4);
        }

        /* 공통 변형 박스 */
        .box {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* 1. skew (Y축 기울임) */
        #matrixScale {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f87171, var(--red-main));
            transform: matrix(1, 0.4, 0, 1, 0, 0);
        }

        /* 2. skew + scale + translate */
        #matrixSkew {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa, var(--blue-main));
            transform: matrix(1, -0.4, 0, 1.2, 50, 0);
        }

        /* 3. scale + skew + translate */
        #matrixTranslate {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #34d399, var(--emerald-main));
            transform: matrix(1.5, 0.57, 0, 0.9, 100, 0);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Transform: matrix()</h1>
        <p class="description">2D 변형 요소(Scale, Skew, Translate)를 단일 행렬 값으로 제어합니다.</p>

        <!-- 구조 안내 구조화 -->
        <div class="matrix-guide">
            <div class="guide-chip">matrix(<span>a</span>, <span>b</span>, <span>c</span>, <span>d</span>, <span>e</span>, <span>f</span>)</div>
            <div class="guide-chip">a/d: Scale(X/Y)</div>
            <div class="guide-chip">b/c: Skew(Y/X)</div>
            <div class="guide-chip">e/f: Translate(X/Y)</div>
        </div>

        <div class="demo-section">
            <!-- 1. Y축 기울임 -->
            <div class="demo-card">
                <label>
                    <span>Y축 기울임</span>
                    <mark class="code-tag">matrix(1, 0.4, 0, 1, 0, 0)</mark>
                </label>
                <div class="box-wrapper">
                    <div id="matrixScale" class="box">Skew Y</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. Skew + ScaleY + TranslateX -->
            <div class="demo-card">
                <label>
                    <span>기울임 + 세로 확대 + 우측 이동</span>
                    <mark class="code-tag">matrix(1, -0.4, 0, 1.2, 50, 0)</mark>
                </label>
                <div class="box-wrapper">
                    <div id="matrixSkew" class="box">Complex 1</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. ScaleX + SkewY + ScaleY + TranslateX -->
            <div class="demo-card">
                <label>
                    <span>가로 확대 + 기울임 + 세로 축소 + 우측 이동</span>
                    <mark class="code-tag">matrix(1.5, 0.57, 0, 0.9, 100, 0)</mark>
                </label>
                <div class="box-wrapper">
                    <div id="matrixTranslate" class="box">Complex 2</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
